  "autobiographical": [
    "Monday night exhaustion where PKD could not complete sentences, all thoughts used up, feeling like reaching the last thought—compared to drug-abuse-level depletion",
    "Tuesday (space shuttle return day) found PKD in the spatial realm, a state he had theorized derives from Christianity",
    "Wednesday receipt of a 'murderous letter' causing him to phone the FBI (parallel to 1974 Xerox missive event)",
    "Wednesday night sudden completion of his binary-switching model, jotted on back of SMLA envelope, refined Thursday and Friday",
    "Drive through city on Tuesday noting 'Lord; how ugly things are'—perception of the BIP as Empire",
    "Dream of the Spinner going blind Sunday night, anticipating mental/spiritual death Monday",
    "Friday return to Brentwood and announcement to Jeanette of perfected vision",
    "Good Friday abstinence from meat (Chinese chicken from Thursday) entirely unconscious, yet fulfilling Holy Week ritual"
  ],
