  "tensions": [
    "PKD claims the sequence of Holy Week was 'jumbled up' (passion Sunday/Monday, death Wednesday, resurrection also on Wednesday/Tuesday) yet argues this disorder proves involuntary participation rather than voluntary performance—but this creates ambiguity about what 'proved' the pattern",
    "The letter came Wednesday but resurrection via spatial realm came Tuesday—sequence is nonlinear, challenging the clean passion-death-resurrection progression",
    "PKD attributes initial spatial realm access to increased Sinnaquan dosage, then explicitly denies this likelihood, leaving causation unclear",
    "The claim that net energy increases in rebirth contradicts thermodynamic intuition and PKD offers no explanation except reference to cosmogenesis—circular reasoning",
    "PKD asserts he had no consciousness or understanding of what was happening, yet he recalls predicting and analyzing it in the moment ('I noted Lord; how ugly things are')",
    "The parallel with 1974 is claimed as verification, but PKD acknowledges 1981's version was 'to a lesser degree'—if scaled-down, does it confirm or dilute the original claim?"
  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "\"I figured out that the spatial realm is the one that folder 90 - 052 - genuine Christianity gets us into; it frees us from time\"",
    "\"what I am saying is that this year, 1981, I relived although to a lesser degree, the series of experiences of 1974 -- relived them during Holy Week\"",
    "\"I suffered and died, but after I died I was resurrected in terms of my world --the spatial world-- and in terms of my vision: my binary switching model of the universe, which I have later recognized as a model of the restored universe, restored by Christ\"",
    "\"It is not so much what my experiences during this Holy Week can be made to mean in themselves that I am concerned with; rather, it is what they implied when applied to 1974... this is something --that was something-- that can only happen in the springtime\"",
    "\"The total system, by passing through this cycle of passion, crucifixion and death, actually gains energy -- this can only be explained in terms of the original act of cosmogenesis\""
  ],
  "uncertainty_flags": [
    "The 'murderous letter' content is never quoted or detailed—only its existence and PKD's phone call to the FBI are mentioned; specific threat is unclear",
    "Sinnaquan dosage and its possible effects are mentioned but then dismissed without evidence; unclear what this drug is or whether PKD was actually taking it",
    "The SMLA envelope is referenced but never explained; the meaning of this abbreviation is not given",
    "The Spinner dream is referenced but not described in detail—how does the Spinner go blind? What narrative leads to this?",
    "PKD refers to 'the novel' and 'THE' but does not specify which work; unclear if this refers to VALIS, UBIK, or another unpublished manuscript",
    "The reference to Reagan assassination attempt with 'the man with the Uzi' seems to reference John Hinckley Jr.'s 1981 attempt (historical), but PKD frames it as personal anguish and later threat, causality unclear",
    "Roger's letter is mentioned but not included; the content of PKD's theological sharing with Roger is inferential only",
    "Jeanette's name is spelled two different ways in the text: 'Jeanette' and 'Jeannette'—unclear if typo or different person"
  ],
  "reading_excerpt": "\"I suffered and died, but after I died I was resurrected in terms of my world --the spatial world-- and in terms of my vision: my binary switching model of the universe, which I have later recognized as a model of the restored universe, restored by Christ; and I even identify this Dasein, this worldview, as 'Christ consciousness'!\"",
